<rml>
<head>
	<title>Character Select Bar</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="charsel_frame.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="char_sel_main.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="char_sel_main">
	<!-- The 0.97k character screen (Scene_CharSelect, UI_DrawLoginBg): the New Character panel at
	     the top, the Delete dragon on the left and the OK dragon on the right, under the dragon
	     frame round the screen (drawn last, over the panels, as the 0.97k client did). Each panel
	     is its art (pointer-events: none) holding the button's hit area, which shows the lit
	     caption under the pointer. Each panel stands off the screen until its .shown brings it on:
	     New Character while a slot is free, Delete and OK while a character is picked; a panel
	     that is not wanted never shows, not even on the first frame. A click on a character sends
	     Delete and OK off the screen and back in (.replay-a and .replay-b take turns on each click), as the 0.97k client did. The 0.97k screen had no menu
	     button: the ESC key opens the menu (#btn_menu_item is hidden); Sven's information bar and
	     corner flourish are left out. While the character-creation dialog is open the panels are
	     hidden (.char-make-open), as the 0.97k client hid them; the frame stays. -->
	<div id="panel" data-class-char-make-open="char_make_open">
		<div id="btn_create_item" class="charsel-panel" data-class-shown="!create_disabled">
			<div id="btn_create" class="charsel-btn" data-class-disabled="create_disabled" data-event-click="charsel_create_click"></div>
		</div>
		<div id="btn_delete_item" class="charsel-panel" data-class-shown="!delete_disabled"
		     data-class-replay-a="character_click_phase == 1" data-class-replay-b="character_click_phase == 2">
			<div id="btn_delete" class="charsel-btn" data-class-disabled="delete_disabled" data-event-click="charsel_delete_click"></div>
		</div>
		<div id="btn_connect_item" class="charsel-panel" data-class-shown="!connect_disabled"
		     data-class-replay-a="character_click_phase == 1" data-class-replay-b="character_click_phase == 2">
			<div id="btn_connect" class="charsel-btn" data-class-disabled="connect_disabled" data-event-click="charsel_connect_click"></div>
		</div>
		<div id="btn_menu_item">
			<div id="btn_menu" class="charsel-btn" data-event-click="charsel_menu_click"></div>
		</div>
		<div id="frame">
			<div id="frame_top_left" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_top_right" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_side_left_top" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_side_right_top" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_side_left_bottom" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_side_right_bottom" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_bottom_left" class="frame-piece"></div>
			<div id="frame_bottom_right" class="frame-piece"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<!-- Rarely shown (account has an item-blocked character); fixed, centered, independent of #panel. -->
	<div id="account_block_message" class="classic-font-text" data-class-hidden="account_block_hidden">
		<div class="line-row"><span class="line">{{account_block_line1}}</span></div>
		<div class="line-row"><span class="line">{{account_block_line2}}</span></div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
